WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.240
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.490
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.950
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.160
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.330
In order to investigate the Demonic threat,

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:32.830
the Guardian Knights of Orvelia decided
to go on an expedition to Galluah Plain.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:38.040
The Black Edge was chosen to serve
as the vanguard of the investigation,

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:42.330
but what they faced there was
the death of a friend.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.910
Before Riheet and the others
could recover from the shock,

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.080
the sorcerer Malduk appears.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:07.450
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:17.740
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:22.330
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.870
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:32.120
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:36.790
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:39.120
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.950
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.580
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.080
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.040
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.490
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:56.490 --> 00:02:01.370
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.040
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.240
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:08.660
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.120
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.330
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:18.200
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.910
<i></i>Battle in the

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.910
<i></i>Badlands

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.540
Your Highness, we can assign men
to take up watch. Perhaps you should rest.

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:39.950
No, I'll be fine.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.370
But...

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.910
I'm sorry, Demia.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:47.160
I just have a bad feeling.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.620
Besides...

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.830
You wouldn't understand.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:58.490
You can never understand us.
Don't say things like that without knowing.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.990
It's hard to put into words,
but I'm concerned.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.040
Then I will accompany you.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.660
Sorry to trouble you.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.240
Please, don't mention it.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:32.160
Malduk...? What are you doing...?

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.580
Dark elves.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.240
Who are you?!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.700
Is this your doing?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:52.870
You knew this territory belongs to us,
the Demons, did you not?

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.160
How dare you! I'll get you
for what you did to Tamm!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.700
Hey, you're alive! Idiot!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.910
Why did you play dead?!

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.870
Back off, Azal!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.000
Azal!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:18.990
Stop!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.120
How do you like my puppet?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.490
Moves around like a living human!
Isn't it exquisite?

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.450
Now dance, my undead!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:36.200
Feast on the life of the living!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:39.950
Snap out of it, Tamm!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.790
Tamm is already dead!
He's just being controlled by that guy!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:00.950
What...

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.830
Tamm...

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.990
Dammit!

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:21.290
You... How dare you do such a thing!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.740
Oh?

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.120
What is that...?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:15.740
Oh, I overdid it. I can't make puppets
if I damage them too badly.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.290
Insolent dark elves!

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.240
You seem to be having some trouble.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.740
Silence.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.950
Ripine...

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.540
Playtime is over.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:23.120
I can't let them take you down right now.
You need to back off.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.040
No...

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.830
Check for survivors.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.290
Yes!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.620
Riheet!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.910
Hold it together! Riheet!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.450
Where am I...?

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.490
Who are you?

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.160
Kasel! Kasel!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.790
Kasel!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.290
Are you all right, Kasel?!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.080
Frey...

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:00.700
I'm so glad. I'm so glad...

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:05.790
Where... What did I...?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.040
What happened to Malduk?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.040
We don't know. He disappeared.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.910
Mr. Kasel!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:14.540
Finally awake.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.040
Hey!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.080
Do you have any idea how worried we were?!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:22.700
Frey was at your side the whole time
taking care of you!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.490
I'm sorry... How long have I been like this?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.870
About half a month, I guess.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.790
For that long?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.040
We have to go.

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.740
Don't push yourself, Kasel.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.620
Stay in bed!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:43.620
We let Malduk get away,
meaning the Dark Lord might come back.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.580
We have to get the Holy Sword
as soon as possible...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:52.910
We understand how you feel.
However, right now, you need to rest.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.660
I'm fine!

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.290
Kasel.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.990
Do you remember what happened to you?

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:08.080
I can't recall what happened
while I was fighting Malduk.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.620
You went on a rampage. You were
so uncontrollable that you fell unconscious.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:17.450
If you let your emotions drive your actions,
that might happen again.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:18.790
A rampage?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.700
It was the most impressive fight, Master Kasel!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.240
Master?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:29.790
I've never seen such awesome power before!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:33.950
You created great gusts of wind,
wielded earth-shattering powers,

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:37.290
and sent that sorcerer running for his life!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:41.410
That must be the power
granted by the goddess Lua...

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:45.120
The power of the Holy Sword!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.240
Me? Such power?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:53.120
Yes! None of us could even approach you!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.580
You are a true hero, Master Kasel!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:01.740
Dale, go let everyone know
that Mr. Kasel is awake.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.700
Yes, Master Kaulah!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.620
Master Kasel is awake!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.120
I'm sorry to cause everyone trouble.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.700
Please don't say that...

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:16.950
Y-Yeah! I'm sure you'll be able
to control the Holy Sword's power!

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.330
Right?

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:25.330
Yeah. For now, just focus on
getting back on your feet.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.660
I understand.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:33.290
I'll go get us some food.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:36.700
I'll use all my skills to cook up
something delicious!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:37.400
I'll go with you.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.620
I'll go check on Dale.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.830
I'll also go out and get some fresh air.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.910
Kasel...

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.410
Don't worry, I'll be right back.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.200
Is something wrong?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.580
Mr. Kaulah, is this...

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.080
This was created during
your fight with Malduk.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.410
Mr. Kasel?

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.870
No, it's nothing.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:25.990
I'm truly sorry about Chief Sieg.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:31.870
Chief Sieg fought bravely to the end,
to defend the Orcs.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.910
He is the pride of all Orcs.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.620
He must surely have joined
the ancestral spirits and watching over us now.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.040
But, without a chief...

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:45.580
For the time being, I will lead my people.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:51.040
So there is nothing for you
to be worried about, Mr. Kasel.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.740
We Orcs owe you a great debt of gratitude.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:59.790
If there is anything I can do, I want to help.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:04.700
If you have any concerns,
please feel free to voice them.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:14.370
I was just startled that I unconsciously
used such tremendous powers.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.830
If this had happened somewhere else,

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:21.240
someone could have gotten
caught in the blast and hurt.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:25.160
"I don't care what happens to me,
as long as I can protect anyone."

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:27.870
I still feel that way--that hasn't changed.

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:33.990
But if that results in me hurting the people
around me, that defeats the purpose.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:40.200
I've never had any doubts
about finding the Holy Sword.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:46.080
I understood that it was my duty--my destiny.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:51.160
Of course, I still want to get the Holy Sword.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.870
It's just that, I'm not sure I understand...

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:59.330
What do I need to do
to correctly use the Holy Sword?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:03.040
How can I be the heir not knowing that?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:07.290
I don't know about the Holy Sword, either.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:12.200
However, as an Orc, I can give you advice.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.700
The Orcs value power and mind.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:22.290
To wield a weapon, one must be strong,
not just in the body, but also in the heart.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.990
Heart...

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:29.580
Yes. You heart was unable to manage
the Holy Sword's power.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.830
That must be why you went on a rampage.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.540
What can I do?

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:43.790
Mr. Kasel. You said you don't mind becoming
a shield to protect others, yes?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.990
Then dedicate yourself to that idea.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:53.200
Wield your power not for your hatred,
but to protect others.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.910
Please, take this!

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.240
All of these, too!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.640
This, too! Oh, and this!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.620
Wait... We can't possibly eat all of this.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.450
Don't be so modest!

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:10.950
We need the hero
to eat plenty and get well soon!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:14.990
Not even Kasel can eat this much.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.790
These guys are so different
from the first time we met them.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:24.160
Pay respect to great strength.
I guess that's how orcs are.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:28.740
Well, I suppose they did turn out to be
a lot nicer than I first thought.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.660
Ugh, so heavy!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:40.370
Anyway, I'm so glad Kasel woke up.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:40.930
Yeah.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:44.740
And he's back to his usual self.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:50.240
While he was fighting Malduk,
he was a bit scary.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:53.910
There's one more lock
on the Holy Sword's seal.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:59.540
Once all of the power is released,
he will have even more strength.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.450
Yeah... I wonder what'll happen to him then?

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.700
You shouldn't worry about that.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:10.120
We'll support him until he unseals
the Holy Sword. Right?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:14.990
You don't have to remind me. Here we go!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:17.620
We have to protect Kasel!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.120
Can't sleep?

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.240
Sorry, did I wake you?

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:12.370
No, I couldn't sleep, either.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:19.910
Thank you.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.410
Yeah...

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:26.870
There's no time.
The nocturnal sun is so big already.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:27.990
Yes...

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:31.580
But right now, I'm worried about you.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:35.870
I'm fine now. Let's leave in the morning.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:39.620
The final key to unlock the last seal
is with a person named Pavel,

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:43.660
in the Windland Snow Mountain,
according to Master Lorraine, right?

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:49.330
Yes... But it's not your health
I'm worried about, it's your emotional state.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:56.740
I don't clearly remember what happened
while I was on the rampage, but...

00:18:56.740 --> 00:19:01.580
I was full of rage and hate towards the Demons,
or something like that.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:05.410
I remember feeling like
I wasn't myself anymore.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.490
Kasel...

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:11.040
It's different from the time I fought
the Demon in the Forest of Elidora.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.580
This time, I was completely gone.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:19.290
I've been pursuing pure power,
so that I can get stronger, but...

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:22.290
I think that's not good enough.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:28.330
If I let my own heart defeat me,
I can't correctly use the Holy Sword's power.

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:33.040
You won't lose.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:37.370
Kasel, you can be quite stubborn,
never giving in once you decide.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:41.660
So once you decide you won't lose,
you won't lose!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.740
Frey...

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.160
Believe in yourself, Kasel.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:50.830
As long as your heart is strong,
you'll never lose yourself again.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.580
I don't think I'm that stubborn.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:58.990
Oh, you sure are.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.410
Remember when you said
you're going to become a knight?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.450
Or when you said you'll go look for Clause?

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.990
You never backed down.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:10.120
The same goes for you, too.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:13.700
Me? I'm not like that.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:19.040
When we left Orvelia, you were
so insistent in coming with me.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.200
Well, th-that was, like...

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.990
Thank you, Frey.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.160
Thank you very much
for everything, Mr. Kaulah.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:37.910
We should be thanking you. Please take care.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:38.910
Yes.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.370
We will fight the Demons here, too!

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:45.160
In the name of Orcish honor, we will defend
these lands from the Demons!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:49.540
I'm glad we got to be friends.
Especially given how terribly we started off.

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:52.410
That's all your fault.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:56.160
No, we were truly rude to you.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:00.740
I know! You are headed for
the Windland Snow Mountains, yes?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.620
Yes, that's right.

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.580
In that case, let us accompany you
to the base of the mountain!

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.950
Thanks, that's helpful!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.410
If you go down our mountain,
you'll see a river. Following it...

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:12.620
Miss Frey.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.290
Yes.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:17.160
There is something I must tell you.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.330
What is it?

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:23.160
When we first met,
I told you about the dream I had.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.950
There is more to that dream.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.870
More?

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:32.990
Mr. Kasel enters the world as a hero
and rushes down on a path of war.

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:37.120
Further down the path, he disappears.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:41.990
What does that mean? Will Kasel really...

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:45.200
A prophetic dream is a message
from the ancestral spirits.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.740
It does not determine the future.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:52.790
You can work to avoid the outcome it predicts.

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:59.660
Please stay by Mr. Kasel's side.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.200
Yes...

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:08.330
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:11.040
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:13.830
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:17.870
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:34.410
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:40.290
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:51.620
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:59.370
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:02.740
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:05.410
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:08.290
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:11.040
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:13.830
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:16.620
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:22.200
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:25.160
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:48.740
Kasel travels to the snowy mountain,

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:53.910
while still unable to break free from
his fear of using the Holy Sword's power.

00:23:53.910 --> 00:24:00.740
On the way, we meet a mercenary
with a freewheeling personality.

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.790
<i></i>The Mercenary with

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.790
<i></i>Wings of Freedom
